        },
        "collapse_LA4zYt": {
          "type": "collapse",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "How do I place a food order?",
            "text": "<p>You have two convenient options: Visit any of our bar tops (beer bar, liquor bar, or ice cream bar) and let them know your table number when ordering, or stay at your table and order through the QR code for contactless ordering.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapse_6Q3iBH": {
          "type": "collapse",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Do you take reservations?",
            "text": "<p>We operate on a first-come, first-served basis for parties under 15 people. Reservations are only available for groups of 15 or more. For large party bookings, please contact us directly to arrange your visit.</p>",
